          <rules>
            <rule id="88b6-fe57-9f79-9232" name="Spiny Growth" hidden="false">
              <description>Target friendly Faction model gains +2 ARM. If a warjack or warbeast hits the affected model with a melee attack, the attacking model suffers d3 damage points immediately after the attack has been resolved unless the affected model was destroyed or removed from play by the attack. Spiny Growth lasts for one round.</description>
            </rule>
