          <rules>
            <rule id="890b-ef97-3218-c0a3" name="Ornery" hidden="false">
              <description>This model gains Retaliatory Strike. Ornery expires after the affected model makes a Retaliatory Strike attack. Ornery lasts for one round. (When a model with Retaliatory Strike is hit by a melee attack made by an enemy model during your opponent&apos;s turn, after the attack is resolved it can immediately make one normal melee attack against that enemy model.)</description>
